-> should renew around <strong>2026-08-01</strong> <!-- -->for about <strong>$119.00</strong>. Annual charges are easy to forget — this is the moment to decide, not after the charge lands.</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin-top:24px"><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://app.subtracker.test/dashboard" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration-line:none;background-color:#1c1917;border-radius:6px;display:inline-block;font-size:14px;padding:10px 18px;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">See the details</a></td></tr></tbody></table><hr class="st-hr" style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;border-color:#e7e5e4;margin:28px 0 12px"/><p class="st-muted" style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#78716c;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px">You are getting this because SubTracker watches your subscriptions for changes that matter. Choose which emails you get on the<!-- --> <a href="https://app.subtracker.test/settings" style="color:#2563eb;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank">preferences page</a>. SubTracker reads transactions to help you decide — it never moves money.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
